    <p class="pk-elixir-tech-copy">Elixir MCP is a <strong>serverless recorder</strong> with one deliberate exception: the cloud has no route to the Clash Royale API at all. Only the <strong>collector fleet</strong> holds IP-bound keys, leasing work from a queue the service prioritizes by expected yield — and the whole fleet shares <strong>one global rate budget</strong>, so more collectors mean resilience, never more API load.</p>
